'''Pokémon Center Lady''' (Japanese: '''ポケモンセンターのお姉さん''' ''Pokémon Center Lady'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Heal 30 damage from 1 of your Pokémon, and it recovers from all {{TCG|Special Condition}}s.
}}

