==Trivia==
* {{TCGP|Potion}} and {{TCGP|Big Malasada}} have less potent versions of this card's effect, but as {{TCGP|Item card}}s instead of {{TCGP|Supporter card}}s.
* This card's effect is similar to the {{TCG|Pokémon Center Lady}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card heals 30 damage instead of 60.

===Origin===
*[[Pokémon Center lady|Pokémon Center ladies]] are characters that attend [[Pokémon Center]]s in every [[core series]] game, who restore the player's Pokémon to full health.
*Both prints of this card feature the Pokémon Center lady inside a Pokémon Center, both as depicted in {{g|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}}.

